        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu na badūgūye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya yenīyo, ū Yesu ūbiza wa kūyūyeelela mu Galilaya dūhū, oya ū kūyeelela ī Būyudaya; nguno a bana Būyudaya bakayūkooba kūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho shegeela shigukulu sha Bayudaya ī sha Maduku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a bazunaye būng'wīla gīkī, “Īngaga shi lūūlū nū kūūnū, ūje na Būyudaya; nū kwene bakībone a bahemba bako ī milīmo yako īyo ūkwīyītaga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiyoolecha hape ū kū banhū bayūbona ūmo ūkwītīlaga; nguno atīho munhū nūūlū ūmò ūyo akakoobaga kūmanīka, alīyo hangī ū kūnū wibisa bisa ū mu katūmamīle kakwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bazuna ye nabo baalī bataalī ū kūnzunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbawīla, “Lītaalī ū kūshika ī likanza lyane ū nene, ī ling'we ī lyene līlīho gwa dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ba mu sī batīko ū kūmukolwa a bing'we, ū nene banikolilwe, nguno nakūbakaanīlaga gīkī ī milīmo yabo yabubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jagi a bing'we ū kū shigukulu, ū nene natūjaga ī haha ū kū shigukulu shenīshi, nguno ī likanza lyane lītaalī ū kūng'wa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wabawīla ī yenīyī wikala Galilaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūja a bazunaye ū kū shigukulu, nū wei ūja, alīyo mu mbisīla, ītī mu kwiyoolecha bo hape. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bayudaya aho balī ū mu shigukulu būyūnkooba, kūnū bakwiwīlaga, “Alī halī ū ng'wene ī gete?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūbūūka yombo nhaale ū ng'wibita kūlwa nguno yakwe; bangī būyūhaya, “Owiza;” alīyo bamò bahayaga, “Yaya akūlembagūlaga banhū dūhū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike walī atīho nūūlū ūmò, ū wa kūgima kūng'haya hape hape, nguno ya kūbogoha Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho shashika ha gatī gatī ī shigukulu, ū Yesu wingīla ū mu hekalu, wandya kūlanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bayudaya būyūkumya balīhaya gīkī, Ū ng'wenūyū ashimanile ginehe ī shandīkwa ū wei, alīyo atalangilwe nūūlū kūlangwa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūbashokeja ūhaya gīkī, Ū būlangi ūbo nakūlangaga būtī bone bo ng'wenekīlī, būlī bokwe ūyo anitūmile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūkooba kwīta īyo ayītogilwe ūyo anitūmile, akūwitegeleja ū būlangi wenūbū ūlū gīkī būfumile kūlī Mulungu, nūūlū nakūhayaga yane ng'wenekīlī dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo akahayaga yakwe ya ng'wenekīlī, akikoobelaga ikūjo lyakwe. Alīyo ūyo akakoobaga ikūjo lyakwe ūyo antūmile, ū ng'wenūyo alī wa ng'hana, na hangī ū mulī wei būtīmo būbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū Musa atang'winhile shilagīlo a bing'we, alīyo atīho nūūlū ūmò wing'we ūyo akashishikīlījaga? Hama ī gīsī nibūlī mulīkooba kūnibūlaga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū būnshokeja gīkī, “Hamo ūlī n'ihūgi shi ī gete, nani ūyo alīkooba kūkūbūlaga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūshosha ūbawīla, “Nakabeeja nīmo gūmò, pye a bose ng'wandya kūkumya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mukasaalaga munhū nūūlū ha sabato, īkī Musa wang'winha shilagīlo sha kūsaala, (nūūlū īkī shitafumile kūlī wei, alīyo kū bakūlūgenji). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubonile īlī būgatū ū munhū ū kūsaalwa nūūlū ha sabato, gīkī shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa shileke kūkenaagūlwa, hama ū nene nibūlī mukanipelanīla kūlwa kūpīja munhū ha sabato? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutasolanhyage ū mu kalamulīle king'we, ng'ūlamula mu būtūngīlīja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitulwa bana Yelusalemu balebe bandya kūbūja gīkī, Ū ng'wenūyū, atī ng'wene ūyo bakūkoobaga kūmūlaga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ī haha angū lolagi alīyomba hape hape dūhū, alīyo batūng'wītīlaga nūūlū mhayo, hamo shi ī gete a basugi bamanile gīkī hū ng'wene ū Kilisito? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nahene ū ng'wenūyū tūmanile shi ūko afumile, lelo ū Kilisito ng'wenekīlī ūlū wiza, ndūhū nūūlū munhū ūmò ūyo akūmana ūko afumīīle!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yesu aho alīlanga ū mu hekalu, ūhamuka n'ilaka lya higūlya ūhaya gīkī, “Na ng'hana bizagi munimanile ū nene, pyī nū kūko nafumile. Gwike natizile kūlwane nene ng'wenekīlī, ūyo anitūmile ng'wene ntūngīlīja; alīyo a bing'we mutaamanile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene naamanile nguno nafumile kūlī wei, hangī hū ng'wene ūyo anitūmile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būhaya kūndima, alīyo īkī ī likanza lyakwe lyalī lītaalī ū kūshikana, atigelile nūūlū ūmò wa kūngoloolela makono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wibita lyenīlo bakakwīla a banhū ba kūnzunya, būyūhaya gīkī, Ū Kilisito ūlū alize, akwīta mitaale kūtinda īyo akwītaga ū ng'wenūyū?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafalisayo būbigwa a banhū bakūng'hayaga mihayo īlī gīko mu kūng'ung'uula ng'ung'uula. Hūna a bagabīji bataale na a Bafalisayo būtūma bashilikale, gīkī baje bakandime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūhaya, “Lyasaagaga ikanza ido no ī lya kwikala hamò ning'we ū nene; najile kūlī we ūyo anitūmile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūnikooba alīyo mutūnipandīka, nīyo mutūdūla ū kwiza ūko nalīkikala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bayudaya bandya kwilūnjalūnja boi benekīlī baliwīla gīkī, Ū ng'wenūyū, alīhaya kūja halī ūko dūtūdūla ū kūmpandīka a bise? Hamo alīhaya kūja kū balobeji ba kū sī ja Bayunani ayūbalanga na Bayunani kwenūko! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyū wagūhaya, ni gūlī na makūlū kī? ‘Ī gīkī, Mukūnikooba alīyo mutūnipandīka,’ nī gīkī, ‘Ūko nalīkikala mutūdūla ū kwiza ko?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha lūshikū lo kūmalīja shigukulu, ūlo lūlī lūshikū lūtaale, ū Yesu akīmīīla ūhamuka n'ilaka lya higūlya ūhaya gīkī, “Ose ose ūyo akolilwe nota ni izage kūlī nene ang'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo ūnizunya, myongo ya minzī gabupanga īkwandya kūsela kūfuma mulī we, gīt'ūmo shandīkwa shihayīlile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyo akagūhaya kūlwa ng'wa Moyo Ng'wela, ūyo bakūng'wanukūla a bazunya; nguno ū Moyo walī ataalī ū kwiza, īkī ū Yesu walī ataalī ū kūgūngūhiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna bangī ū ng'wibita aho bīyigwa ī mihayo yenīyo, būhaya gīkī, “Ī gete ū ng'wenūyū hū ng'wene ū Ng'hangi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangī gīkī, Ū ng'wenūyū Kilisito!” Alīyo bamò būhaya, Ū Kilisito afume Galilaya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūhaya ī shandīkwa shihayile gīkī ū Kilisito alī wa lūganda lo ng'wa Daūdi, na gīkī akūfuma Betelehemu, igūngūli īlo lyalī lya ng'wa Daūdi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbiza bikīla kīla a banhū kūlwa nguno yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamò babo būyūgengagenga kūhaya kūndima, alīyo atigelile nūūlū ūmò wa kūngoloolela nkono gokwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose a bashilikale būshoka ū kū bagabīji bataale na a Bafalisayo, būshikīla kūbūjiwa gīkī, “Nibūlī ng'waneka?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bashilikale benabo būshosha balīhaya gīkī, “Ataalī kūyomba munhū nūūlū ūmò gīt'ūmo akūyombelaga ū munhū ng'wenūyū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bafalisayo būbawīla, “Gashi hangī na a bing'we ng'wakalemva lemva! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī nani ū mu basugi, nūūlū ū mu Bafalisayo ūyo anzunije ū munhū ng'wenūyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ī libita lya banhū īlī, a bene angū bazumilwe dūhū; nguno nīyo nī shilagīlo batashimanile!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wabo, Nikodemo, ūyo walī waja kūlī Yesu ī kwandya, ūbawīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bing'we ī shilagīlo shise shikanamulaga ū munhū nūūlū ataalī kūdegelekwa tame, īmanwe īyo akūyītaga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo būnshokeja balīng'wīla gīkī, Ū bebe nang'ho, ūlī muna Galilaya hamo shi ī gete? Gīsīlījaga, ūkūbona nang'ho ī gīkī ataalī kwilonga ng'hangi kūfuma Galilaya nūūlū kamò!” [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna busalang'hana, būlī ng'wene ūja kū ng'wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.7.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
